Quest Kobolds Leader Killed
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Razzlewhip Mudgrubber
        (Owner of (Killing unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Set VariableSet QuestKoboldsLeaderKilled = True
        Trigger - Run Quest Kobolds Update <gen> (checking conditions)
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
